PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C3

   1 a 0000 E48C3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE SAME statement spelled UNQUALIFIED, exactly CREATE:34.  If
   4 a 0006 qualification is a front-end matter the store bytes are identical
   5 a 0006 to E48C2's; a different spelling here would mean the two resolve
   6 a 0006 to different operand classes. */
   7 c 0006   dcl
   8 c 0006     1 rec,
   9 c 0006       2 name character(30) varying;
  10 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  11 c 0006   name = 'AB';
  12 c 0013   b = (name = 'EOF');
  13 c 0025   put list('B=', b);
  14 c 0047   stop;
  15 a 004A end E48C3;

